[8.800445, "o", "gasket hopper layout\r\n====================\r\n\r\ngaskcli/boot.rs dispatches bind, jab, and cork.\r\n\r\nPipeline modules:\r\n- loomkit/  roster writer\r\n- rimcap/   compiled span\r\n- hopmat/   live hop table\r\n- lidpit/   seal writer\r\n- slipread/ card parse\r\n\r\nCards live in /app/buscards.\r\nbind refreshes /app/mistwell/roster.json and /app/loomkit/emit.lst.\r\ncork writes /app/corkbay/seal.json.\r\nFixture copies of the cards sit at /app/cardbak/buscards.\r\n\r\nRebuild the binary with /app/stoke.sh after source edits.\r\n"]
[8.800605, "o", "--- cards ---\r\n"]
[8.803299, "o", "/app/buscards/g_bias.card\r\n"]
[8.806681, "o", "LABEL TRIM_BIAS\r\nWIRE 12\r\nREPLY bias-ok\r\n"]
[8.806959, "o", "/app/buscards/f_latch.card\r\n"]
[8.809147, "o", "LABEL HOLD_LATCH\r\nWIRE 10\r\nREPLY latch-ok\r\n"]
[8.809671, "o", "/app/buscards/a_fan.card\r\n"]
[8.812594, "o", "LABEL SET_FAN\r\nWIRE 1\r\nREPLY fan-ok\r\n"]
